    # you "Hey Bast, do you want to have some fun?"
    you "嘿，巴斯特，想不想找点乐子？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2208
translate chinese_simplified visit_exchange_a589c4ee:

    # "Bast looks around to make sure no one can hear you. She lowers her voice."
    "巴斯特环顾四周，确认没人能听见你们说话，然后压低了声音。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2210
translate chinese_simplified visit_exchange_be3775b3:

    # bast "You mean... Like the last time?"
    bast "你是说……像上次那样？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2212
translate chinese_simplified visit_exchange_b8499140:

    # you "Yes... I'm horny as hell..."
    you "嗯……我欲火焚身了……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2215
translate chinese_simplified visit_exchange_b7fe4468:

    # bast "You... You can't be serious... We only just did it!"
    bast "你……你不是认真的吧……我们刚刚才做过！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2217
translate chinese_simplified visit_exchange_46c1dc5a:

    # you "Aw... Okay."
    you "啊……好吧。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2220
translate chinese_simplified visit_exchange_c054fc44:

    # "She bites her lip."
    "她咬着嘴唇。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2222
translate chinese_simplified visit_exchange_93545409:

    # bast "Oh, [MC.name]... *blush*"
    bast "哦，[MC.name]……*脸红*"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2224
translate chinese_simplified visit_exchange_075e4666:

    # bast "*whisper* Follow me."
    bast "*耳语* 跟我来。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2254
translate chinese_simplified visit_exchange_26689f83:

    # bast "You do not have [source_nb] [source] to buy this."
    bast "你没有足够的[source_nb]个[source]来购买此物。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2285
translate chinese_simplified wood_intro_49655f52:

    # "Breathing in the fresh ocean breeze, and trying to ignore the smell of rotting fish, you take a walk around the shipyard."
    "你深吸一口清新的海风，努力无视腐鱼的腥臭，在造船厂周围漫步。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2287
translate chinese_simplified wood_intro_6c927173:

    # "Zan is a prime destination for trade from all over the known world, and its shipyard is always buzzing with activity from workmen, seamen, seagulls, moguls, bribe-givers, bribe-takers, bribe-agnostics, idlers and other riff-raff."
    "赞恩是已知世界各地贸易的汇聚之地，这里的造船厂整日喧闹不休，工人、水手、海鸥、大亨、行贿的、受贿的、对贿赂不置可否的、游手好闲的，以及各色三教九流混迹其间。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2289
translate chinese_simplified wood_intro_a456aa9e:

    # "On one side of the harbor, new ships are being built on drydocks. On the other side, old ships are being refurbished or taken apart."
    "港口的一侧，新船正在干船坞里建造；另一侧，旧船则在被翻新或拆解。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2291
translate chinese_simplified wood_intro_c64fea32:

    # "Because of its ever-growing population, Zan has stripped most of the surrounding country of its timber. Therefore, wood is a valuable commodity, so instead of letting it go to waste, some enterprising people dismantle old boats to make new ones."
    "由于人口不断增长，赞恩周边的木材几乎已被砍伐殆尽。因此木头成了紧俏货。为了不让它们白白浪费，一些有生意头脑的人会拆解旧船，再造新船。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2293
translate chinese_simplified wood_intro_1caccc6f:

    # "You spend some time watching the workers as they go. It seems easy enough, although it takes some strength to rip away the rusty nails that hold the planks together."
    "你花了一阵子观察工人们的操作。看上去并不难，不过要把固定木板的锈钉子撬下来，还是得花些力气。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2295
translate chinese_simplified wood_intro_69c98287:

    # you "I think I've got the hang of it."
    you "我想我已经摸到门道了。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2299
translate chinese_simplified wood_intro_5a611303:

    # "You may now collect {b}wood{/b} from the shipyard. Yield will depend on your {b}Strength{/b}."
    "现在你可以从造船厂采集{b}木材{/b}了。产量取决于你的{b}力量{/b}。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2309
translate chinese_simplified dye_intro_8931657f:

    # "As you take a walk down the beach, you notice it's more than just a place for swimmers."
    "沿着海滩散步时，你注意到这里不只是泳客的去处。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2311
translate chinese_simplified dye_intro_b84750e5:

    # "Some industry also takes place alongside the leisure."
    "除了休闲娱乐，这里也有些产业在运转。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2313
translate chinese_simplified dye_intro_d198c8f0:

    # "Dye-making is a particularly fascinating one. The women herbalists use simple spells to turn seaweed, seashells and other refuse from the ocean into bright dyes of every conceivable color."
    "其中尤以制染最为迷人。草药师女人们施展简单的法术，把海藻、贝壳和海里捞来的各种废料，变成你能想象到的各种鲜艳染料。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2315
translate chinese_simplified dye_intro_8d4bac6c:

    # "You discuss the techniques with the eldest of the women, being particularly interested in how they make blue dye, a rarely occuring color in the natural world."
    "你和其中最年长的一位探讨起这些技艺，尤其好奇她们如何调配蓝色染料——这种颜色在自然界可是极其罕见。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2317
translate chinese_simplified dye_intro_c8c173bd:

    # you "I see... It's much easier than hunting a blue bear for its blood..."
    you "原来如此……这比猎杀蓝熊取血方便多了……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2321
translate chinese_simplified dye_intro_635181cc:

    # "You have learnt how to brew {b}dye{/b} from washed up material at the beach. Yield will depend on your {b}Spirit{/b}."
    "你已经学会了在海滩上利用冲上岸的材料熬制{b}染料{/b}。产量取决于你的{b}精神{/b}。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2331
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_7468bc18:

    # "The stables are teeming with animals and people on any given day. Today, it's extra-crowded, given that a large party of foreign officials has just arrived in the city."
    "马厩里任何一天都是人和牲口挤得满满当当。今天更是格外拥挤，因为一大队外国官员刚刚进城。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2333
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_1b04bb48:

    # you "Hey! Watch out!"
    you "喂！小心！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2335
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_0919d05e:

    # "A careless noble and his steed nearly crushed you. You decide it's best to slip inside one of the buildings to let the crowd pass."
    "一个莽撞的贵族和他的坐骑差点把你撞倒。你决定躲进旁边的建筑里，等人群过去再说。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2337
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_e71e585b:

    # you "Well, this is technically trespassing, but no one will mind if I just wait here a minute..."
    you "好吧，这严格说来算私闯民宅，不过我就等一小会儿，没人会介意的……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2339
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_e545b3d6:

    # "A herd of cattle is already parked inside. The stink is almost unbearable, and you start looking for another way out."
    "里面已经拴着一群牛。恶臭几乎令人窒息，你开始另寻出口。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2341
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_36b53701:

    # you "There's light that way... Maybe there's a store out front..."
    you "那边有光……也许前面有家铺子……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2343
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_8f9cf66f:

    # man "Arios be praised, you've come! You sure took your sweet time!" with vpunch
    man "" with vpunch

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2345
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_70317dea:

    # "You are startled to hear someone call you, and turn around to see a diminutive old man with oversized spectacles, only to be whacked by his cane right on the shoulder."
    "有人突然叫住你，吓了你一跳。你转过身，看到一个戴着夸张大眼镜的小老头，随即被他的拐杖正中肩膀挨了一下。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2351
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_9329eee9:

    # you "Ouch! Watch it, old man..."
    you "哎哟！看着点，老头……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2353
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_0fb774c6:

    # man "Don't you dare!"
    man "你还敢躲！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2359
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_afc65f67:

    # you "Aw!"
    you "哎！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2361
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_59c44fd7:

    # "The geezer hits you again, and even though it's a weak strike, it still stings. For an instant, you wonder if you should fight back, but he's just a frail old man."
    "老头又敲了你一下，力道虽弱，还是生疼。你一时犹豫要不要还手，但他只是个瘦弱的老头。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2363
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_c49c6806:

    # man "Four hours I've been waiting! Four hours since I sent to the guild for help! While you were idling, no one was here to tend to the shop!"
    man "我等了四个小时！四个小时前我就向公会求援了！你磨蹭到现在才来，铺子一直没人照看！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2365
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_0024038c:

    # man "Stupid, unreliable guild officers... I told them there would be double payment today..."
    man "公会那些蠢货办事员，一点都不靠谱……我都说了今天给双倍工钱……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2367
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_cb38bbe3:

    # "He eyes you suspiciously through his nearly opaque glasses."
    "他隔着那副几乎不透光的眼镜，狐疑地打量着你。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2369
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_b0858f46:

    # man "Say, are you the same boy they usually send? You look tall for a 12-year old..."
    man "我说，你跟他们平时派来的那孩子是同一个吗？一个十二岁的娃娃，长得可真够高的……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2371
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_2cfe6b3e:

    # you "Look, pal, I... Wait, did you say 'double payment'?"
    you "听着，大爷，我……等等，你刚才说『双倍工钱』？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2373
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_66036300:

    # man "Yeah, if you finally haul your ass to work! The shop is that way!"
    man "是啊，只要你麻溜儿地干活！铺子在那边！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2375
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_0c35abb4:

    # man "Man the store, dammit, I have to tend to the animals!"
    man "快去看铺子，该死，我还得喂牲口！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2377
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_e479ae15:

    # "The strange man shoves you out towards the store, before limping towards the animals who are waiting for food and drink."
    "怪老头把你推向铺子，自己一瘸一拐地朝那些等着吃喝的牲口走去。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2379
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_8050e427:

    # you "What have I got myself into..."
    you "我这是摊上什么事了……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2383
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_55b755fb:

    # "The old man's store is full of grumbling people, waiting for someone to show up. They immediately gather around you, voicing their complaints and orders all at the same time."
    "老头儿的铺子里挤满了嘟嘟囔囔、等着人来招呼的顾客。他们一见你，立刻呼啦一下围了上来，抱怨和订货声同时炸开了锅。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2385
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_8cd31e14:

    # you "Not all at once, not all at once... You sir, what did you say you wanted again?"
    you "别挤别挤，一个个来……这位先生，您刚才说想要什么来着？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2391
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_41eb158a:

    # you "Phew... It's finally finished..."
    you "呼……总算忙完了……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2393
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_477856ae:

    # "The old man is in charge of keeping animals safe for travellers who are set for a short stay in the city. Herding cattle around in the narrow streets of Zan is far from ideal."
    "老头负责为短途停留城里的旅客照看牲口。在赞恩狭窄的街道上放牧，实在算不上什么好差事。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2395
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_16eb8294:

    # "The store job is pretty easy, as you only need to match the right owner with the right animals and update the logbook, but managing impatient customers requires some wit."
    "看铺子的活儿倒不难，只要对上号——把正确的牲口交给正确的主人，再记好登记簿就行，但应付那些不耐烦的顾客，可得动点脑子。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2397
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_a26ec81c:

    # man "There you are, kiddo! I hope nothing is amiss in the logbook, or I'll whip your teenage ass!"
    man "你在这儿啊，小鬼！但愿登记簿上没出什么岔子，不然我可要抽烂你这小屁孩的屁股！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2399
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_fb9251e1:

    # man "Well... Everything looks in order."
    man "嗯……看起来都没错。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2401
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_45d98aaa:

    # you "(Can you even read anything in there?)"
    you "（那上面写的字你真的看得清吗？）"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2403
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_363cf000:

    # you "Now, about that payment you promised..."
    you "那么，说说你答应的工钱吧……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2405
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_d1ba6a4b:

    # man "Ah, yes, the leather skins..."
    man "啊，对，皮革……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2407
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_b9d66f2b:

    # you "What??? The payment is in leather?"
    you "什么？？？工钱用皮革付？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2409
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_1551e79e:

    # man "Why yes, of course... The payment is leather skins, as negotiated with the tanner's guild. But you knew that, of course?"
    man "那当然了……跟皮匠公会谈好的，报酬就是皮革。这个你当然知道吧？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2411
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_017aa3b4:

    # you "O-Of course..."
    you "当……当然知道……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2413
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_026086dc:

    # man "Well, I'm withholding your payment for today. That will teach you to show up late."
    man "不过嘛，今天的工钱我要扣下了。就当作给你迟到的教训。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2415
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_980152ab:

    # you "Whaaat!!! That's unfair!" with vpunch
    you "" with vpunch

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2417
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_b4f21a82:

    # man "But tell you what, kiddo, I like the way you handle the customers. Truly remarkable, for a boy your age."
    man "但跟你说，小鬼，我很喜欢你应付客人的那套本事。以你这年纪来说，真是了不得。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2419
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_dae0ec55:

    # you "..."
    you "……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2421
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_19076eb6:

    # man "If you show up again to help with the shop, I'll pay you properly."
    man "你要是再来帮忙看铺子，我会正正经经付你工钱。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2426
translate chinese_simplified leather_intro_563e60f5:

    # "You can now earn {b}leather{/b} from helping at the stables. Yield will depend on your {b}Charisma{/b}."
    "现在你可以通过在马厩帮忙赚取{b}皮革{/b}了。产量取决于你的{b}魅力{/b}。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2437
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_ae1d66b1:

    # "The old ruins belonged to the non-human empire that first settled Zan's current location, Cimeria."
    "这片古老遗迹曾属于最先定居赞恩如今所在之地的非人帝国——西米利亚。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2439
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_8cf674d5:

    # "How it was built or what it was used for is unknown to all but the most reclusive scholars."
    "它是如何建造的、曾作何用途，只有那些深居简出的学者才略知一二。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2441
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_07d37705:

    # "It's very easy to get lost in the maze of ruined structures, each very similar yet slightly different from the next."
    "在这错综复杂的废墟迷宫里极容易迷路，每一座建筑都彼此相似，却又各有细微差别。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2443
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_0bef17f5:

    # "Some people even claim the place changes over time, structures appearing and disappearing out of thin air... Those people are mad, of course."
    "甚至有人宣称这里会随时间变化，建筑凭空出现又凭空消失……那些人当然是疯子。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2445
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_71ee01d6:

    # "One thing's for sure, though, the old ruins are a prime source for building materials."
    "不过有一点可以肯定：这片古老遗迹是建筑材料的绝佳来源。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2447
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_63c7aec4:

    # "Zan is always in need of new buildings, and the old ruins are so expansive that it never seems to run out of materials, no matter how many walls people dismantle."
    "赞恩对新建房屋的需求永无止境，而遗迹又是如此辽阔，无论人们拆了多少堵墙，材料似乎永远也用不完。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2449
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_a3cdc654:

    # "The old palaces are especially renowned for their Cimerian marble, a fancy stone that Zan's elite has a particular fondness for."
    "其中古老的宫殿尤以盛产西米利亚大理石闻名，这种华美的石材深受赞恩权贵阶层的钟爱。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2451
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_34df0699:

    # "The only problem is, the ancient Cimerians knew how to build flawless architecture that stands the test of time, and Cimerian marble is extremely tough."
    "唯一的问题是，古代西米利亚人深谙建造经得住时间考验的完美建筑之道，西米利亚大理石坚硬无比。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2453
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_cc2c9bd5:

    # "You watch a dozen men trying and failing to extract a block of marble from a weak-looking structure."
    "你看见十几个大汉正试图从一座看似破败的建筑里凿出一块大理石，却屡屡失败。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2455
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_c929cac4:

    # "Only the strongest men can break their walls and extract that stone. Perhaps that's why the city still hasn't run out of Cimerian marble."
    "只有最强壮的男人才能砸开那些墙壁、取出石材。也许这正是城里的西米利亚大理石至今仍未采尽的原因。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2457
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_70aac154:

    # "Not to mention there's a curse... Nah, forget about that."
    "更别说还有诅咒什么的……算了，当我没说。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2459
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_7db28017:

    # you "Anyway. Those guys are doing it all wrong. I bet I could recover some of those marble slabs if I did this..."
    you "总之，那帮人的方法完全不对头。换作是我的话，准能弄出几块大理石板……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2463
translate chinese_simplified marble_intro_b02f412c:

    # "You have discovered how to extract {b}marble{/b} from the old ruins. Yield will depend on your {b}Strength{/b}."
    "你发现了从古遗迹中开采{b}大理石{/b}的方法。产量取决于你的{b}力量{/b}。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2474
translate chinese_simplified silk_intro_6a983f1a:

    # "The hanging gardens are a wonderful place, tended by the magic guild's airmancers and extending high above Zan. The view is magnificent from here."
    "空中花园是一处美妙之地，由魔法公会的气系法师们照料，高高悬于赞恩上空。从这里俯瞰，景色壮丽无比。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2476
translate chinese_simplified silk_intro_19d11233:

    # "The trees are buzzing with magic energy and undulating strangely, connected to each other by complex networks of vines."
    "树木间涌动着魔法能量，以奇特的韵律起伏摇摆，彼此由复杂的藤蔓网络连接在一起。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2478
translate chinese_simplified silk_intro_a0427549:

    # "Creeping along those vines is a unique animal Zan is known all around Xeros for: the Zanic silkworm."
    "在那些藤蔓上蠕动着一种克瑟罗斯全境闻名的珍奇动物：赞恩蚕。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2480
translate chinese_simplified silk_intro_33b67048:

    # "A silkworm is a fat, white worm that is typically a foot long, although the biggest can be the size of a large dog."
    "赞恩蚕是一种肥硕的白虫，通常有一英尺长，不过最大的能长到大型犬那么大。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2482
translate chinese_simplified silk_intro_e2bf4d4b:

    # "They are slow-paced, majestic animals. Silkworms are a delicacy for nobles around Zan, who like to eat a whole one roasted in butter for new year's eve, but very pricey."
    "它们行动迟缓，气度雍容。赞恩蚕是周边贵族的美味珍馐，除夕夜他们喜欢用黄油烤上一整条来享用——不过价格相当不菲。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2484
translate chinese_simplified silk_intro_91289a63:

    # "That is because the silkworm's primary function makes them very valuable: patient enchanters can extract fine silk from the worm's body, using a process that takes a bit of magic skill, and is also pretty gross."
    "这是因为赞恩蚕最主要的用途让它们身价倍增：有耐心的附魔师能从蚕体内抽取出精细的丝线，这个过程需要些魔法技巧，而且相当恶心。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2486
translate chinese_simplified silk_intro_95203447:

    # you "Well, I could do that, I guess... The spell is not that difficult... But that elbow move is tricky. And do I really have to use my teeth for that?"
    you "嗯，我应该也行吧……法术倒是不难……但那个手肘的动作很刁钻。还有，那一步真的非用牙不可吗？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2490
translate chinese_simplified silk_intro_096b7f43:

    # "You have figured out how to weave {b}silk{/b} from the hanging gardens. Yield will depend on your {b}Spirit{/b}."
    "你掌握了在空中花园抽取{b}丝绸{/b}的技巧。产量取决于你的{b}精神{/b}。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2500
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_ebd6f897:

    # "The guild quarter hosts representatives from every possible trade in Zan, except for the Magic and Banking guilds that have their own separate quarter."
    "公会区汇聚了赞恩各行各业的人士，唯独魔法公会和银行公会在别处拥有自己独立的辖区。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2502
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_4b745e39:

    # "It is bustling with activity, traders of all kinds and origins negotiating all kinds of deals, large amounts of money changing hands at a dizzying speed."
    "这里热闹非凡，来自五湖四海的商人洽谈着各式各样的买卖，大笔金钱以令人眼花缭乱的速度易手。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2504
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_536562de:

    # "The guild quarter is also where the mining activities are concentrated in Zan, as the guilds handle claims and stakes for the miners."
    "赞恩的矿业活动也集中在公会区，因为采矿权和股份都归各公会打理。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2506
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_5049007a:

    # "It is technically forbidden for miners to mine outside of their official claimed territory, but claim-jumping is still extremely common."
    "严格来说，矿工在登记的矿权范围之外开采是明令禁止的，但越界抢采之事依然屡见不鲜。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2508
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_2aa99504:

    # "As you walk by one of the large mines, you hear someone whisper to you."
    "当你走过一座大矿时，听见有人低声叫你。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2510
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_47ac83a7:

    # man "Psst, Mister!"
    man "嘘，这位先生！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2512
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_efea331f:

    # "Turning around, you notice a scrawny miner, taking a break near the protective fence that surrounds the ore mine."
    "你转过身，看到一个干瘦枯槁的矿工，正靠在矿场外围的防护栏边歇脚。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2514
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_7af088ad:

    # "Miner" "Sir, d'you have a minute? You're not a guildsman, right? No tattoos..."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2516
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_b9e5b416:

    # "Guildmembers wear complex tattoos indicating their trade and level. The miner's guild has especially spectacular tattoos, mining officials inking their face so it is black as coal. They are pretty easy to spot."
    "公会成员身上刺有标示行业与等级的繁复纹身。矿工公会的纹身尤为气派，矿务官员甚至把整张脸纹得黑如煤炭，一眼就能认出来。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2518
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_5c317860:

    # you "No, I'm not."
    you "不，我不是。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2520
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_c27793fe:

    # "You eye him suspiciously."
    "你狐疑地打量着他。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2522
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_54f45253:

    # you "Why? Are you in trouble with the guild?"
    you "怎么？你招惹公会了？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2524
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_0a68ea71:

    # "He spits."
    "他啐了一口。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2526
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_4f551cd3:

    # "Miner" "Shalia take 'em all! We work our asses off in the mine day and night, but at the end those bloody bureaucrats take a 70 percent cut just doin' nuthin'."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2528
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_1fb53abf:

    # you "That sucks. Can't you refuse their terms?"
    you "真够倒霉的。你就不能拒绝他们的条件吗？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2530
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_53bac5bc:

    # "Miner" "I wish... Some of the boys threatened to go on strike, so they had thugs beat 'em up and kick 'em out, only to replace 'em the next day."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2532
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_eb899c56:

    # "Miner" "They say the next one to complain will go to the salt mines... Like a damn orc!"
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2534
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_fbe03d0b:

    # you "Well, seems like you've got no choice then..."
    you "这么说来，你是没得选了……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2536
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_5c4b9380:

    # "Miner" "Yeah, we're stuck here, we can't even go anywhere 'til we finish our weekly shift. It's like a fuckin' prison camp!"
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2538
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_93b85989:

    # "Miner" "But me and the boys, we got an idea. See, a guy like you is free to come and go. We could make you a deal..."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2540
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_97c99c6a:

    # "He gives you a cunning look."
    "他狡黠地看了你一眼。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2542
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_c3694090:

    # you "Where are you going with this?"
    you "你到底想说什么？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2544
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_1e57b69d:

    # "Miner" "The guards here, they're extra lazy. They don't bother to check the perimeter outside of the main gate, ever."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2546
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_c96f2868:

    # "Miner" "I could smuggle small amounts of ore through that hole in the fence, see? They'd be none the wiser."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2548
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_83327430:

    # you "And give it to me? For what?"
    you "然后交给我？图什么？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2550
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_9eb7970c:

    # "Miner" "There are always some contacts at the black market that are looking to buy ore outside of the guild circuit. You'd need to haggle, we'd have to cut the price a bit... But it'd still be better than payin' the fuckin' guild tax, by a long shot."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2552
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_5617ed9b:

    # you "So I find some buyers and sell them your ore. What's in it for me? Do I get a share of the gold?"
    you "然后我找买家，把你的矿石卖给他们。我能有什么好处？金币能分我一份吗？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2554
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_e3eb1f6e:

    # "Miner" "Nah, that wouldn't do. We need all the cash we can get up here. Booze and whores ain't cheap, ya know? And we need plenty of both to keep goin'."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2556
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_6706c383:

    # "Miner" "But listen. When you come back and give us our due, I'll give you some of the extra ore lying around for free. You can keep it or sell it, as you wish."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2558
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_96821c89:

    # you "I see... And how do you know I won't just sell your ore and steal your money?"
    you "原来如此……那你怎么知道我不会把你的矿石卖了，再把钱独吞？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2560
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_289165cb:

    # "He chuckles."
    "他嘿嘿一笑。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2562
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_ff8431ea:

    # "Miner" "We've thought about that, of course... That's why I'm only ever going to give you small amounts of ore to sell, anyway."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2564
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_6930cd31:

    # "Miner" "If you burn us, the deal is off, and you'd better never come back. Plus you might find yourself shanked in the back unexpectedly on a dark night..."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2566
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_0a782f4d:

    # "Miner" "But we could get a good workin' relationship. Whadaya say? Friends?"
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2568
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_97d12466:

    # "He spits in his hand and holds it out for you to shake it. You look at his dirty paw with some disgust."
    "他往自己手心啐了一口，伸过来要跟你握手。你看着那只脏爪子，心里有些嫌弃。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2570
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_6f2f4fc4:

    # you "I'll give it some thinking."
    you "容我考虑考虑。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2572
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_e19eeae9:

    # "He smirks."
    "他咧嘴一笑。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2574
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_d12a6e55:

    # "Miner" "Suit yerself, brother. Make up your mind quickly, though, before I offer the deal to someone else."
    "Miner" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2578
translate chinese_simplified ore_intro_6e3d37b3:

    # "You have learnt how to help the miners smuggle {b}ore{/b} from the guild quarter. Yield will depend on your {b}Charisma{/b}."
    "你学会了如何帮矿工从公会区走私{b}矿石{/b}。产量取决于你的{b}魅力{/b}。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2589
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_d80ef30c:

    # "As you enjoy the sight of Zan's mighty waterfalls, you hear an eery noise that makes your hair stand."
    "正欣赏着赞恩磅礴的瀑布美景，你忽然听到一声毛骨悚然的怪响，汗毛都竖了起来。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2593
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_f4da045c:

    # you "S-Spooky... Are there ghosts here?"
    you "好……好吓人……这里有鬼吗？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2595
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_caf34ba3:

    # "An old gentleman standing next to you notices your dismay, and addresses you with a friendly voice."
    "站在你身旁的一位老绅士察觉到你的惊惶，便语气温和地同你搭话。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2597
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_8ef6fd14:

    # "Old man" "Look alive, kid! This ain't no supernatural sound."
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2599
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_662a5aa3:

    # you "It-It's not?"
    you "不……不是吗？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2601
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_30d0c355:

    # "Old man" "Hells no. It's just the wind running through the caves behind the waterfall."
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2603
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_f4dc0fa7:

    # you "Caves, you say?"
    you "您说是洞穴？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2605
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_4d26ea10:

    # "Old man" "Oh, yes! There's a huge network of caves that starts there and runs through the whole mountain range. Some say it's many times bigger than Zan, and Zan is the largest city in the world!"
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2607
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_990f348e:

    # you "Wow... Is it... Safe?"
    you "哇……那里……安全吗？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2609
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_88bd6c62:

    # "The old man chuckles."
    "老人轻笑几声。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2611
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_7b8238a2:

    # "Old man" "Well, people get lost in there more often than not, and die alone in the darkness... Or not alone... But don't listen to those silly stories about the undead!"
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2613
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_69e34b9b:

    # you "Un... Undead?"
    you "亡……亡灵？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2615
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_76e695f8:

    # "Old man" "Yeah, ghouls, vampires, and worse... That's just rumors. It's just giant blood-sucking bats if you ask me."
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2617
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_d8940c87:

    # you "GIANT BLOOD-SUCKING BATS?"
    you "吸血的巨型蝙蝠？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2619
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_41d744c3:

    # "Old man" "Oh, yes! Some are big as a pony!"
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2621
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_b520bee4:

    # you "Why would anyone ever go there!!!"
    you "那种鬼地方怎么会有人去！！！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2623
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_fef2b347:

    # "Old man" "Why, for the diamonds of course."
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2625
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_0d0d38e8:

    # you "Diamonds?"
    you "钻石？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2627
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_a7efe856:

    # "Old man" "Yes... There are places in the caves where you can just pick them right up from the mud. Many adventurers try their luck there."
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2629
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_724ebeec:

    # you "How come the King or the nobles haven't got their hands on these diamonds first?"
    you "国王和贵族们怎么没先下手把这些钻石弄到手？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2631
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_2e3e416b:

    # "Old man" "Oh, believe you me, they've tried! *chuckle* But it's no use sending an army in there, most passageways are only broad enough for a single man... And there are pockets with so little air to breathe, the large parties would just suffocate."
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2633
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_28437bc6:

    # "Old man" "So they are content to just buy their diamonds from careless adventurers like the rest of us sensible folks do."
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2635
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_9cca1607:

    # "Old man" "Not that I'd have the means to buy any, mind you... Say, young one, care to spare a denar?"
    "Old man" ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2637
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_9b9a5b26:

    # you "*sigh*, here you go... Thanks for the information, though."
    you "*叹气*，喏，给您……不过还是谢谢您告诉我这些。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2644
translate chinese_simplified diamond_intro_eac14305:

    # "You paid the old man 50 gold. You have discovered that you can sometimes find {b}diamonds{/b} in the caves behind the waterfall."
    "你付给老人50金币。你得知瀑布后面的洞穴里有时能找到{b}钻石{/b}。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2716
translate chinese_simplified test_challenges_d320cc6e:

    # "You ran away."
    "你逃走了。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2732
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_0417c7d0:

    # shopgirl "Hello, handsome!"
    shopgirl "你好啊，帅哥！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2734
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_247cb2ad:

    # shopgirl "Say, I've noticed you come by often these days..."
    shopgirl "话说，我注意到你最近常来……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2736
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_336a7f29:

    # you "Well, yeah. I've got a business to run, and your items can be useful to me..."
    you "嗯，是啊。我有门生意要做，而你这儿的东西对我挺有用……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2738
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_cccebaa7:

    # shopgirl "But I've noticed sometimes you come and leave empty-handed. That's just... *sad face*"
    shopgirl "可我发现，有时候你来了却空手而归。那真让人……*难过脸*"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2740
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_ceadf0a1:

    # you "Well, yeah, sometimes I just don't find what I want..."
    you "呃，是啊，有时我就是找不到想要的东西……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2742
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_558be043:

    # shopgirl "I see! Then, I have a solution for you. Hear me out. We could expand our... relationship."
    shopgirl "我明白了！那我有个办法。你听我说。我们可以拓展一下彼此的……关系。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2744
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_5fef97bf:

    # you "Business, or pleasure?"
    you "是谈生意呢，还是寻欢呢？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2748
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_b82531ce:

    # shopgirl "Business {i}is{/i} pleasure, darling... *giggle*"
    shopgirl "生意{i}就是{/i}享受，亲爱的……*咯咯笑*"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2750
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_66df0f90:

    # shopgirl "You see, if you cover parts of my expenses, I could {b}restock my inventory{/b} more regularly. It's costly of course, but useful, right?"
    shopgirl "你看，如果你帮我分担一部分开销，我就能更频繁地{b}补充货物{/b}。当然这花费不菲，但很有用，不是吗？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2752
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_a9673c51:

    # shopgirl "I will only do it once a day, though. It's a lot of work..."
    shopgirl "不过我一天只补一次货。毕竟这活儿不轻松……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2754
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_2ccb1047:

    # you "Interesting. Go on."
    you "有意思。继续说。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2756
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_a5111acb:

    # shopgirl "In addition, I am looking to {b}extend the shop counter{/b}, but I am missing some materials."
    shopgirl "另外，我想{b}扩建店铺柜台{/b}，但手头还缺些材料。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2758
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_acd889a9:

    # shopgirl "If you provide me with the right resources, I could stock more items, increasing the choice for you!"
    shopgirl "如果你提供我需要的资源，我就能囤更多货品，让你的选择更丰富！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:2760
translate chinese_simplified shop_restock_intro_2f9bdf1b:

