    you "是真的。希露是我珍贵的助手，我所有的私事和生意都放心交给她打理。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6718
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_261c5433:

    # sill happy "Oh, Master! *blush*"
    sill happy ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6720
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_754aff0c:

    # taxgirl "Really? Odd, a pimp getting sentimental about a sex slave... Well, it takes all kinds."
    taxgirl "哦？真有意思，一个皮条客居然对性奴动了感情……世上什么样的人都有啊。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6724
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_f4b25374:

    # you "It's true. Sill is no common whore, she is reserved for my personal use."
    you "没错。希露不是寻常妓女，她是我专门留下来自己享用的。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6727
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_26e27cbf:

    # sill "Err... Well, I guess..."
    sill "呃……嗯，算是吧……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6729
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_2cc3c47d:

    # taxgirl "A sex slave is a sex slave. You make her feel special one day, then sell her the next day to a gang bang joint down the street..."
    taxgirl "性奴就是性奴。你今天让她觉得自己很特别，明天就把她卖给街角那家群交窑子……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6731
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_b4b0df99:

    # sill "No!"
    sill "不！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6737
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_f80ca6a9:

    # you "Sill is just one of my many cum dumps. Perhaps when I tire of her, I'll let some vagrants use her as they see fit..."
    you "希露不过是我的众多肉便器之一。等我哪天玩腻了，或许会找些流浪汉随便处置她……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6739
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_2f64ec98:

    # "Sill's jaw drops, and she becomes livid."
    "希露惊得下巴都掉了，脸色变得煞白。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6741
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_8bf635bd:

    # taxgirl "Cold... I wonder if you mean it."
    taxgirl "真冷酷……我很好奇，你说的是不是真心话。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6743
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_303aea1a:

    # "The woman moves closer to Sill, her gaze unflinching."
    "那女人向希露凑近，目光毫不躲闪。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6745
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_80f01e70:

    # sill "What do you..."
    sill "你想干什……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6749
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_5fde57c1:

    # sill "Aah!" with vpunch
    sill "" with vpunch

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6751
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_428167e9:

    # "The woman reaches under Sill's dress and squeezes her butt, hard."
    "那女人把手伸进希露的裙子下面，用力捏了一把她的屁股。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6753
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_c3ac51c2:

    # taxgirl "Firm, yet supple... Good thighs, youthful breasts..."
    taxgirl "紧实又有弹性……大腿不错，乳房也很饱满……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6755
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_89e7a4a1:

    # taxgirl "It seems your wares are of better quality than this poor setting advertises."
    taxgirl "看来你这儿的货色，比你这寒酸门面所展现的要好嘛。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6757
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_ece6eaec:

    # you "Enough! You barge in here, criticize my establishment, molest my, er, personal slave... Who are you, and what do you want?"
    you "够了！你闯进来，对我的店指手画脚，还非礼我的——呃——私人奴隶……你到底是谁，想要什么？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6759
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_086b0765:

    # taxgirl "Of course. Forgive me for not introducing myself, I'm not a big fan of pointless social niceties."
    taxgirl "当然。请原谅我没有自报家门，我一向不喜欢那些无聊的社交客套。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6761
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_16d11e02:

    # taxgirl "I'm the local liaison officer for the Slavers' Guild. I'm going to handle your account."
    taxgirl "我是奴隶行会在本地的联络官。从现在起，由我来负责你的账目。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6765
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_51b1ba07:

    # you "Handle my... what? I don't understand..."
    you "负责我的……什么？我不明白……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6767
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_b408be08:

    # "The woman looks unphased."
    "那女人面不改色。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6772
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_6845225d:

    # taxgirl "Do you need me to explain everything?" nointeract
    taxgirl "" nointeract

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6777
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_d6da436c:

    # you "I get it. You'll come here on the 15th of every month, tell me how much money I owe, then come to collect on the 1st day of the next month. Oh joy."
    you "我懂了。你每个月15号来告诉我该交多少钱，然后下个月1号再来收钱。真是令人欣喜啊。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6779
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_c9a0833d:

    # taxgirl "Seems like you know everything already. Very well. Our accountants tell me that this month's payment is going to be {b}[NPC_taxgirl.current_tax]{/b} denars. See you on the 1st."
    taxgirl "看来你全都知道了。很好。我们的会计告诉我，这个月的税金是{b}[NPC_taxgirl.current_tax]{/b}第纳尔。1号见。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6786
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_5b8cbdb4:

    # taxgirl "Of course. Tell me, Mister [MC.name], how do you feel about taxes?"
    taxgirl "当然。告诉我，[MC.name]先生，你对税收怎么看？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6789
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_65dc13d5:

    # you "Taxes? They're..." nointeract
    you "" nointeract

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6793
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_ab28eeb8:

    # you "Well, I suppose they're a necessary evil. Someone has to fund all the public services that we enjoy, such as the Court torturers and executioners..."
    you "这个嘛，我想那是必要的恶吧。总得有人为我们享受的公共服务买单，比如宫廷的刑讯官和刽子手……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6795
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_d4e21d34:

    # taxgirl "How sheepish of you. Nevertheless, I'm sure you're not eager to line the King's coffers with your hard-earned gold..."
    taxgirl "你可真够温驯的。不过，我肯定你也不急着用辛苦赚来的金币去填国王的金库吧……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6797
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_685847ec:

    # you "Well..."
    you "这个嘛……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6801
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_72f042f7:

    # you "Taxes! Ha, I hate taxes! Who needs them? The thieving State, that's who!"
    you "税收！哈，我恨死税收了！谁需要那玩意儿？偷东西的政府才需要！"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6803
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_614ac67d:

    # taxgirl "Exactly! And what did the State ever do for us?"
    taxgirl "没错！政府到底为我们做过什么？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6805
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_b16f2e07:

    # sill happy "Well..."
    sill happy ""

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6807
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_93790edd:

    # sill "There's sanitation, medicine, education, foodbanks, public order, irrigation, roads, a fresh water system, public heal-"
    sill "有卫生设施、医疗、教育、食物赈济、公共秩序、灌溉、道路、净水系统、公共医——"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6809
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_8cda1bdc:

    # taxgirl "That's right, nothing! My point exactly!" with vpunch
    taxgirl "" with vpunch

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6811
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_2258de27:

    # you "Exactly."
    you "没错。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6814
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_55a85432:

    # you "Taxes are... not the fucking point! What do you want?" with vpunch
    you "" with vpunch

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6816
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_ee58839c:

    # taxgirl "Easy. I have a proposal for you. A {i}business{/i} proposal."
    taxgirl "很简单。我有个提议。一个{i}生意{/i}上的提议。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6818
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_0554e33d:

    # taxgirl "See, you're just another upstart in this city, fresh off the boat with a brand new licence. But as soon as you start making any real money, the King's tax collectors are going to flock to you like vultures on a smelly carcass."
    taxgirl "你看，你不过是这座城里又一个新贵，揣着崭新的执照刚下船。但只要你开始真正赚到钱，国王的税吏就会像秃鹫扑向腐尸一样蜂拥而至。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6820
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_e3b7704a:

    # you "Nice image..."
    you "比喻得真妙……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6822
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_ddfceb23:

    # taxgirl "They'll drive you out of business in no time. But what if..."
    taxgirl "他们很快就会让你关门大吉。但如果……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6824
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_dce3c679:

    # taxgirl "What if I told you there was a way to {i}avoid{/i} the King's taxes entirely?"
    taxgirl "如果我告诉你，有一种方法可以彻底{i}免缴{/i}国王的税呢？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6826
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_d03d6bd7:

    # you "Uh? You've got my attention."
    you "呃？你成功引起我的兴趣了。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6828
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_35921915:

    # taxgirl "As a sex slave owner, you are entitled to the protection of the Slavers' Guild. And we cast a long shadow in this city. Perhaps you've heard of our leader, Cloud?"
    taxgirl "作为性奴的拥有者，你有权获得奴隶行会的庇护。而我们在这座城里可是手眼通天。或许你听说过我们行会的领袖——克劳德？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6830
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_29bd28e4:

    # you "Maybe. Who's that, precisely?"
    you "也许吧。那到底是个什么人？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6832
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_24026821:

    # taxgirl "Well, even I don't know his exact identity. Cloud is a very discreet man... or woman."
    taxgirl "这个嘛，连我都不知道他的确切身份。克劳德是个非常低调的人……或者说女人。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6834
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_adabf363:

    # taxgirl "But Cloud holds half the court under his or her thumb, and rumor has it, even the King himself. Enough to make all your tax worries disappear..."
    taxgirl "但克劳德把半个宫廷都捏在手心里，有传言说连国王本人也不例外。这点能量足以让你所有的税务烦恼烟消云散……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6836
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_6394e86a:

    # you "Great-"
    you "太好了——"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6838
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_d9197cd3:

    # taxgirl "...provided you pay us protection money."
    taxgirl "……只要你向我们缴纳保护费。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6840
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_20896c97:

    # you "Doh!" with vpunch
    you "" with vpunch

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6842
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_49f6fdcb:

    # you "Wait a minute... So in order to avoid the King's tax, I have to pay your Guild's... tax?"
    you "等等……所以为了躲开国王的税，我就得向你们行会缴……税？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6844
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_848533e4:

    # taxgirl "We really prefer the term 'progressive membership fee'. It gives you access to a range of services, such as the special business lounge at the harbor when waiting for your ship to arrive. There's lobster."
    taxgirl "我们更习惯称之为‘累进式会费’。它能让你享受一系列服务，比如在码头等船时专用的商务休息室，那儿还有龙虾。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6848
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_e71459ee:

    # you "*frown*"
    you "*皱眉*"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6850
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_93e2878a:

    # taxgirl "But listen: unlike the King's lackeys, we're not about to bleed you dry. We like our members to thrive, after all."
    taxgirl "不过听好了：我们可不像国王的走狗那样要把你榨干。说到底，我们还是希望自家会员兴旺发达的。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6852
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_ae5bd5e8:

    # you "*sigh* There's no escaping swindlers in this town, I see. I suppose now you're going to say that it's 'an offer that I can't refuse', aren't you?"
    you "*叹气*看来这座城里是躲不开骗子了。我猜你接下来就要说这是‘一个我无法拒绝的提议’，对吧？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6854
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_d60d586e:

    # taxgirl "It's an offer that you can't... Wait! That was my line."
    taxgirl "这可是个你无法拒绝的……等等！那是我的台词。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6856
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_099d6fc9:

    # taxgirl "Anyway, only death and taxes are inevitable, my dear. And even so, we've got some very good necromancers these days... So maybe only taxes."
    taxgirl "总之，我亲爱的，死亡和税收才是世间唯二不可避免的东西。再说如今我们有几位了不起的亡灵法师……所以恐怕只剩下税收了。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6858
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_0760ca71:

    # you "But wait... I have questions."
    you "等等……我有问题。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6860
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_3ad7b2de:

    # taxgirl "Of course."
    taxgirl "当然。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6866
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_b9d17dfd:

    # you "Okay, suppose I accept your deal. How would it work?"
    you "好吧，假设我接受你们的交易。具体是怎么运作的？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6868
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_aa609d35:

    # taxgirl "It's very simple. We'll place a magic seal in your accounting books, which will tell us your net income at the end of every month."
    taxgirl "很简单。我们会在你的账本上施加一道魔法印记，每到月末它就会向我们报上你的净收入。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6870
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_d0dda879:

    # taxgirl "Don't even think of tampering with it - it'll have a very powerful shrinking-dick curse attached with your name on it."
    taxgirl "别想打它的主意——上面附着一道非常厉害的缩阳咒，写的可是你的名字。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6872
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_8040c233:

    # you "*gulp*"
    you "*咽口水*"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6874
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_d9371b60:

    # taxgirl "I will announce the fee you owe us on the 15th of every month. It's a very simple formula involving 10 different progressive tax brackets, the district you're in, the weather over the last 47 days and in what mood I woke up on that particular morning."
    taxgirl "我会在每月15号公布你欠我们的会费。计算方式非常简单，只涉及10个不同的累进税率档、你所在的城区、过去47天的天气，以及那天早上我醒来时的心情。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6876
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_5ede5581:

    # taxgirl "Also, there is a little bit of membership fee inflation. {b}The membership fee may increase every month.{/b} But this progression will be reset every time you move to a new district."
    taxgirl "另外，会费还有一点小小的通胀。{b}会费每月都有可能上涨。{/b}不过每当你迁往新城区时，涨幅就会重置。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6878
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_f32aae98:

    # you "Uh? Why?"
    you "啊？为什么？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6880
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_02993caf:

    # taxgirl "Let's say it's a little nudge to keep you moving in the right direction. The guild takes an 'up or out' approach to its membership..."
    taxgirl "就当是轻轻推你一把，让你朝着正确的方向前进。行会对会员实行‘不上则退’的方针……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6882
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_6adf3435:

    # taxgirl "It's best to simply remember that {b}the higher your income, the more the 'membership fee' will cost{/b}."
    taxgirl "你只需记住一点：{b}收入越高，‘会费’就越贵{/b}。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6884
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_bb29446b:

    # taxgirl "And also remember that {b}the more time passes in a district, the more it will cost{/b}. But don't worry, there's an upper limit we won't breach."
    taxgirl "还要记住：{b}在同一个城区待得越久，收费就越高{/b}。不过别担心，我们设有一个不会突破的上限。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6890
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_843af735:

    # taxgirl "The fee will be announced on the 15th of every month."
    taxgirl "会费将在每月15号公布。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6892
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_699d3d47:

    # taxgirl "I will come to collect on {b}the 1st of the next month{/b}. Ample time to prepare the adequate sum."
    taxgirl "我会在{b}下个月1号{/b}上门收取。你有充足的时间备好这笔钱。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6894
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_03ac3aec:

    # you "Grr..."
    you "可恶……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6896
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_9be94ceb:

    # taxgirl "Please note that some moons have positive or negative impact on your income. You should manage your budget accordingly."
    taxgirl "请注意，某些月亮会对你的收入产生正面或负面影响，请相应地管好你的预算。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6902
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_636519b2:

    # you "Outrageous! And what if I refuse?"
    you "岂有此理！那我要是拒绝呢？"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6904
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_c68e0f7a:

    # taxgirl "Oh, you're perfectly entitled to refuse."
    taxgirl "哦，你当然有拒绝的权利。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6906
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_222b26a9:

    # taxgirl "But without protection money, it's possible that a squad of goons headed by a one-eyed ogre called 'Gutspill' will visit your brothel at night, set fire to the place, and chop your manhood off..."
    taxgirl "不过要是不交保护费的话，说不定哪天夜里，一支由独眼食人魔‘破肠者’率领的打手队就会光顾你的青楼，放火烧了这地方，再把你那活儿剁下来……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6908
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_daac11c7:

    # taxgirl "Unless of course the King's collectors find you first because of an anonymous tip that you're hoarding some treasure, and decide to torture you to know where you stashed your cash."
    taxgirl "当然，也可能国王的税吏先一步找上门——有人匿名举报你私藏财宝，于是他们决定对你用刑，逼问你把现金藏在了哪儿。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6910
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_311e16fa:

    # taxgirl "Those are all hypotheticals, of course. We wouldn't know anything about that. *smirk*"
    taxgirl "当然，以上纯属假设。我们对此一无所知。*坏笑*"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6913
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_0ab67b2e:

    # you "Hmpf. I've seen worse in the war."
    you "哼。我在战场上见过更狠的。"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6915
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_6c71a35a:

    # taxgirl "You may be a good fighter, but eventually you'll let your guard down... Everyone has to sleep..."
    taxgirl "你也许是个出色的战士，但总有松懈的时候……人总是要睡觉的嘛……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6918
translate chinese_simplified tax_intro_menu_438297c0:

    # you "Oh really? I've got a range of spells I could use to prevent that..."
    you "是吗？我恰好有不少法术可以防止那种事发生……"

# game/core/systems/events_dispatcher.rpy:6920
